---
import { issuesUrl } from "../data/site";
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import { formatReadableDate } from "../lib/dates";

const updatedOn = "2026-09-15";
---
<Layout title="Terms of Use: Estimates, Not Advice | MathMyRate" description="Terms of use for MathMyRate: results are estimates, fee rules cover named scenarios only, and nothing here is tax, legal, or financial advice.">
  <main id="main-content" class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-16 md:px-8 md:py-24">
    <p class="eyebrow">Terms</p>
    <h1 class="display mt-4 text-5xl font-bold leading-none md:text-6xl">Fair use, plainly stated.</h1>
    <p class="mt-6 text-sm text-ink/60">Last updated <time datetime={updatedOn}>{formatReadableDate(updatedOn)}</time>.</p>
    <div class="guide mt-6 text-lg">
      <h2>Estimates, not advice</h2>
      <p>Every result is an estimate generated from the inputs you supply and the documented assumptions shown on each page. Nothing here is tax, accounting, legal, or financial advice. You are responsible for the amounts you quote, charge, or file.</p>
      <h2>Fee rules are scenario-specific</h2>
      <p>Provider fee rules apply only to the account market, currency, product, and channel their official source documents, and providers can change their pricing at any time. A result produced for an unsupported scenario, or after a provider's price change without a reviewed update, may be wrong. Each fee page names its supported scenario and review date.</p>
      <h2>No warranty</h2>
      <p>This site is provided as is, without warranties of any kind, express or implied, including merchantability, fitness for a particular purpose, and non-infringement. Availability, correctness, and completeness are not guaranteed.</p>
      <h2>Limitation of liability</h2>
      <p>To the maximum extent permitted by law, the site's operator is not liable for any damages arising from the use of, or inability to use, this site or its results, including underquotes, overquotes, mispriced fees, and tax positions.</p>
      <h2>Permitted use</h2>
      <p>You may use the calculators for planning your own work and sales. You may not misrepresent this site as affiliated with any payment provider, or present its estimates as professional advice given to third parties.</p>
      <h2>Changes and contact</h2>
      <p>These terms may change as the site grows; the date at the top shows the last change. Questions and corrections can go to the <a href={issuesUrl}>public issue tracker on GitHub</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
